sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P0 as Moderator / Administrator
    participant P1 as Web Application (System)
    participant P2 as Application Database
    participant P3 as Facebook / Instagram Publishing API
    P0->>P1: openPublicationPreview(draftId, selectedPlatforms)
    P1->>P2: load draft, media variants and connection context
    P2-->>P1: return publication data
    P1-->>P0: display previews and platform issues
    P0->>P1: confirmPublish(platforms, version, previewToken)
    P1->>P1: validate ownership, draft status, current review and quality gate
    Note over P0,P3: Validate applicable category and preview checks. An invalid/stale preview or blocked AI quality stops publishing, return errors for correction.
    loop [each selected platform]
    P1->>P2: lock draft, check existing published platform ID
    P2-->>P1: return existing publication state
    alt [already published on platform]
    P1->>P1: reuse published ID, avoid duplicate creation
    else [website not yet published]
    P1->>P2: create active news, store published_news_id
    P2-->>P1: return news ID
    else [Facebook or Instagram not yet published]
    P1->>P3: publish image + post text / caption
    P3-->>P1: return platform ID or publishing error
    alt [provider success]
    P1->>P2: store facebook_post_id / instagram_media_id
    else [provider failure]
    P1->>P1: record safe error for this platform, continue other targets
    end
    end
    end
    P1->>P2: merge publication_results, retain successful platform IDs
    opt [all stored publication results successful]
    P1->>P2: set draft.status = published
    end
    P2-->>P1: return final per-platform state
    P1-->>P0: display success or partial-failure summary
    opt [retry failed targets]
    P0->>P1: retry failed platforms after correcting issues
    P1->>P1: repeat checks and publishing loop, reuse successful IDs
    end
